Z||000008||GodSend||10-16-2001||02:25 PM||||Although the screen does look small from the pics, its really not all that bad when you get in the car.  The cost of lcd moduels goes up dramatically by the inch  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">.<P>I had G.T rented, but the cd's were so bad I could not copy them.  My local Zellers has GT-2 on for 24$ Canadian, so I should just pick it up  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">.<P>I have planned to remove the PSOne for the winter (to play inside) - It takes a total of 5 minutes to remove, so If I am really in a bored mood, I could always remove it  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">||||reg||1
